    "text": "A premium service has to look worth booking again.\n\nHi {{FIRST_NAME}},\n\nThe real test of a professional tan is not under treatment-room lighting. It is how the client feels wearing it later in daylight, in photographs and when they decide whether to rebook.\n\nMalibu Professional Spray is a universal bronze, 10% DHA formula with a stated 6–8-hour development window. For day-to-day application, the formula uses under 35 ml for a full-body tan and works with standard HVLP systems.\n\n- Efficient application: a repeatable full-body application using under 35 ml with standard HVLP equipment.\n- Simplified professional setup: one universal bronze formula to assess in your own treatment-room workflow.\n\nIt supports a natural-looking finish and a clearer consultation conversation: the right depth and finish for the client’s plans, not simply how dark.\n\nRequest your complimentary professional trial\n{{TRIAL_LINK}}\n\nPrefer to test it with your team first? Reply SAMPLE and Matthew will help personally.\n\nMatthew at Jimmy Coco Pro\nSunless Partnerships · Jimmy Coco (UK)\n\nJIMMY COCO (UK) LIMITED · 22 St. James's Walk, London, England, EC1R 0AP\n\nYou are receiving this because you are a professional contact at {{BUSINESS_NAME}} and we believe this message is relevant to your business.\nUnsubscribe: {{RESEND_UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}\n",
