    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"><meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\"><meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\"><title>What to look for when you test Jimmy Coco Pro</title><!--[if mso]><style>.serif{font-family:Georgia,serif!important}.sans{font-family:Arial,sans-serif!important}</style><![endif]--><style>body,table,td,a{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%}table,td{mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0}img{-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic;border:0;height:auto;line-height:100%;outline:none;text-decoration:none}body{margin:0;padding:0;width:100%!important;background:#EAE2D8}a{color:#A77952}@media only screen and (max-width:600px){.container{width:100%!important}.px{padding-left:26px!important;padding-right:26px!important}.stack{display:block!important;width:100%!important;padding-left:0!important;padding-right:0!important}}</style></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#EAE2D8;\"><div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;color:#EAE2D8;\">Assess application, finished result and service fit on a real client before deciding.&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#EAE2D8;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:34px 12px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" class=\"container\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:600px;max-width:600px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:6px 0 22px;\"><a href=\"https://jimmycoco.co.uk\" style=\"display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://jimmycoco.email/email-assets/logo.webp\" width=\"240\" height=\"70\" alt=\"Sunless by Jimmy Coco\" style=\"display:block;width:240px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;\"></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"background:#FBF8F3;border-radius:4px;padding:46px 52px 40px;\"><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A77952;\">The professional trial</p><h1 class=\"serif\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:33px;line-height:1.14;color:#24211E;letter-spacing:-.01em;\">A useful trial gives you something real to judge.</h1><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;color:#3B3630;\">Hi {{FIRST_NAME}},</p><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;color:#3B3630;\">By this stage, the key question is whether the solution performs in your hands, through your equipment and on your clients.</p><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;color:#3B3630;\">When you assess a complimentary 100 ml professional trial sample on a real client, there are three practical checks:</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:2px 0 24px 0;\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:22px;padding:5px 0;color:#A77952;font-size:15px;\">•</td><td class=\"sans\" style=\"padding:5px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#3B3630;\"><strong>Application:</strong> how smoothly the solution works through your standard HVLP setup at under 35 ml for a full-body tan.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:22px;padding:5px 0;color:#A77952;font-size:15px;\">•</td><td class=\"sans\" style=\"padding:5px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#3B3630;\"><strong>Finished result:</strong> how the universal bronze develops over its stated 6–8-hour window and reads in daylight and photographs.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:22px;padding:5px 0;color:#A77952;font-size:15px;\">•</td><td class=\"sans\" style=\"padding:5px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#3B3630;\"><strong>Service fit:</strong> whether the colour, finish and consultation work for the service you want to offer.</td></tr></table><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;color:#3B3630;\">There is no complex application process and no obligation. If the formula is right for your menu, the ongoing trade minimum is one <strong>1-litre bottle (£60)</strong>.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0 0;\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#26231F\" style=\"border-radius:3px;\"><a href=\"{{TRIAL_LINK}}\" class=\"sans\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:15px 30px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFFDF9;text-decoration:none;border-radius:3px;\">Request your complimentary professional trial</a></td></tr></table><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#7A726A;\">Reply <strong>TRIAL</strong> and Matthew will review the request personally.</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:30px 52px 8px;\"><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3B3630;\">Matthew at Jimmy Coco Pro<br><span style=\"color:#7A726A;font-size:13.5px;\">Sunless Partnerships · Jimmy Coco (UK)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:24px 52px 8px;\"><div style=\"border-top:1px solid #DCD2C6;\"></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:14px 52px 30px;\"><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#948B81;\">JIMMY COCO (UK) LIMITED · 22 St. James's Walk, London, England, EC1R 0AP<br>You are receiving this because you are a professional contact at {{BUSINESS_NAME}} and we believe this message is relevant to your business. <a href=\"{{RESEND_UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}\" style=\"color:#948B81;text-decoration:underline;\">Unsubscribe</a>.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "text": "A useful trial gives you something real to judge.\n\nHi {{FIRST_NAME}},\n\nBy this stage, the key question is whether the solution performs in your hands, through your equipment and on your clients.\n\nWhen you assess a complimentary 100 ml professional trial sample on a real client, there are three practical checks:\n\n- Application: how smoothly the solution works through your standard HVLP setup at under 35 ml for a full-body tan.\n- Finished result: how the universal bronze develops over its stated 6–8-hour window and reads in daylight and photographs.\n- Service fit: whether the colour, finish and consultation work for the service you want to offer.\n\nThere is no complex application process and no obligation. If the formula is right for your menu, the ongoing trade minimum is one 1-litre bottle (£60).\n\nRequest your complimentary professional trial\n{{TRIAL_LINK}}\n\nReply TRIAL and Matthew will review the request personally.\n\nMatthew at Jimmy Coco Pro\nSunless Partnerships · Jimmy Coco (UK)\n\nJIMMY COCO (UK) LIMITED · 22 St. James's Walk, London, England, EC1R 0AP\n\nYou are receiving this because you are a professional contact at {{BUSINESS_NAME}} and we believe this message is relevant to your business.\nUnsubscribe: {{RESEND_UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}\n",
