    "preview": "A practical next step for reviewing the professional order route and relevant support for your business.",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en-GB\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"><meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\"><meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\"><title>How to introduce Jimmy Coco Pro to your treatment menu</title><!--[if mso]><style>.serif{font-family:Georgia,serif!important}.sans{font-family:Arial,sans-serif!important}</style><![endif]--><style>body,table,td,a{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%}table,td{mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0}img{-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic;border:0;height:auto;line-height:100%;outline:none;text-decoration:none}body{margin:0;padding:0;width:100%!important;background:#EAE2D8}a{color:#A77952}@media only screen and (max-width:600px){.container{width:100%!important}.px{padding-left:26px!important;padding-right:26px!important}.stack{display:block!important;width:100%!important;padding-left:0!important;padding-right:0!important}}</style></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#EAE2D8;\"><div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;color:#EAE2D8;\">A practical next step for reviewing the professional order route and relevant support for your business.&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#EAE2D8;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:34px 12px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" class=\"container\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:600px;max-width:600px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:6px 0 22px;\"><a href=\"https://jimmycoco.co.uk\" style=\"display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://jimmycoco.email/email-assets/logo.webp\" width=\"240\" height=\"70\" alt=\"Sunless by Jimmy Coco\" style=\"display:block;width:240px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;\"></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"background:#FBF8F3;border-radius:4px;padding:46px 52px 40px;\"><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A77952;\">Partner support</p><h1 class=\"serif\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:33px;line-height:1.14;color:#24211E;letter-spacing:-.01em;\">Introducing a named premium treatment starts with a practical plan.</h1><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;color:#3B3630;\">Hi {{FIRST_NAME}},</p><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;color:#3B3630;\">Once you have decided the formula fits your service, the next conversation is about introducing it in a way that works for your treatment menu and clients.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:2px 0 24px 0;\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:22px;padding:5px 0;color:#A77952;font-size:15px;\">•</td><td class=\"sans\" style=\"padding:5px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#3B3630;\"><strong>Professional solution:</strong> start with the 1-litre Malibu Professional Spray bottle.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:22px;padding:5px 0;color:#A77952;font-size:15px;\">•</td><td class=\"sans\" style=\"padding:5px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#3B3630;\"><strong>Relevant aftercare:</strong> consider the focused retail edit only where it supports your client-care approach.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:22px;padding:5px 0;color:#A77952;font-size:15px;\">•</td><td class=\"sans\" style=\"padding:5px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#3B3630;\"><strong>Individual next step:</strong> review the order route and any available service-support materials directly with Matthew before making a wider commitment.</td></tr></table><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;color:#3B3630;\">If you are planning an upcoming menu refresh, you can review the professional litre order route or request the complimentary trial first.</p><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0 0;\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#26231F\" style=\"border-radius:3px;\"><a href=\"https://www.jimmycoco.pro/products/malibu-professional-spray-1l#complete-order\" class=\"sans\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:15px 30px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFFDF9;text-decoration:none;border-radius:3px;\">View professional ordering options</a></td></tr></table><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#7A726A;\">Still need to sample first? <a href=\"{{TRIAL_LINK}}\">Request your complimentary 100 ml professional trial</a> or reply <strong>TRIAL</strong>.</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:30px 52px 8px;\"><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3B3630;\">Matthew at Jimmy Coco Pro<br><span style=\"color:#7A726A;font-size:13.5px;\">Sunless Partnerships · Jimmy Coco (UK)</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:24px 52px 8px;\"><div style=\"border-top:1px solid #DCD2C6;\"></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:14px 52px 30px;\"><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#948B81;\">JIMMY COCO (UK) LIMITED · 22 St. James's Walk, London, England, EC1R 0AP<br>You are receiving this because you are a professional contact at {{BUSINESS_NAME}} and we believe this message is relevant to your business. <a href=\"{{RESEND_UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}\" style=\"color:#948B81;text-decoration:underline;\">Unsubscribe</a>.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "text": "Introducing a named premium treatment starts with a practical plan.\n\nHi {{FIRST_NAME}},\n\nOnce you have decided the formula fits your service, the next conversation is about introducing it in a way that works for your treatment menu and clients.\n\n- Professional solution: start with the 1-litre Malibu Professional Spray bottle.\n- Relevant aftercare: consider the focused retail edit only where it supports your client-care approach.\n- Individual next step: review the order route and any available service-support materials directly with Matthew before making a wider commitment.\n\nIf you are planning an upcoming menu refresh, you can review the professional litre order route or request the complimentary trial first.\n\nView professional ordering options\nhttps://www.jimmycoco.pro/products/malibu-professional-spray-1l#complete-order\n\nStill need to sample first? Request your complimentary 100 ml professional trial or reply TRIAL.\n\nMatthew at Jimmy Coco Pro\nSunless Partnerships · Jimmy Coco (UK)\n\nJIMMY COCO (UK) LIMITED · 22 St. James's Walk, London, England, EC1R 0AP\n\nYou are receiving this because you are a professional contact at {{BUSINESS_NAME}} and we believe this message is relevant to your business.\nUnsubscribe: {{RESEND_UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}\n",
    "checksum": "0f823112add6b70bc96a5d15f621e7a11b04bf3b7693775552a5c0ba46835641",
