    "preview": "A trial-first way to explore treatment value and relevant aftercare for your clients.",
    "html": "<!DOCTYPE html><html lang=\"en-US\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><head><meta charset=\"utf-8\"><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\"><meta http-equiv=\"X-UA-Compatible\" content=\"IE=edge\"><meta name=\"x-apple-disable-message-reformatting\"><title>A premium spray-tan service — with a second client-care moment after the appointment</title><!--[if mso]><style>.serif{font-family:Georgia,serif!important}.sans{font-family:Arial,sans-serif!important}</style><![endif]--><style>body,table,td,a{-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;-ms-text-size-adjust:100%}table,td{mso-table-lspace:0;mso-table-rspace:0}img{-ms-interpolation-mode:bicubic;border:0;height:auto;line-height:100%;outline:none;text-decoration:none}body{margin:0;padding:0;width:100%!important;background:#EAE2D8}a{color:#A77952}@media only screen and (max-width:600px){.container{width:100%!important}.px{padding-left:26px!important;padding-right:26px!important}.stack{display:block!important;width:100%!important;padding-left:0!important;padding-right:0!important}}</style></head><body style=\"margin:0;padding:0;background:#EAE2D8;\"><div style=\"display:none;max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;font-size:1px;line-height:1px;color:#EAE2D8;\">A trial-first way to explore treatment value and relevant aftercare for your clients.&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;&nbsp;&zwnj;</div><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"background:#EAE2D8;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:34px 12px;\"><table role=\"presentation\" class=\"container\" width=\"600\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"width:600px;max-width:600px;\"><tr><td align=\"center\" style=\"padding:6px 0 22px;\"><a href=\"https://jimmycoco.co.uk\" style=\"display:inline-block;text-decoration:none;\"><img src=\"https://jimmycoco.email/email-assets/logo.webp\" width=\"240\" height=\"70\" alt=\"Sunless by Jimmy Coco\" style=\"display:block;width:240px;max-width:100%;height:auto;border:0;outline:none;text-decoration:none;\"></a></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"background:#FBF8F3;border-radius:4px;padding:46px 52px 40px;\"><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0 0 20px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#A77952;\">West Coast professional partnerships</p><h1 class=\"serif\" style=\"margin:0 0 24px;font-family:Georgia,'Times New Roman',serif;font-weight:400;font-size:33px;line-height:1.14;color:#24211E;letter-spacing:-.01em;\">A premium tan is one appointment. The client relationship can continue after it.</h1><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;color:#3B3630;\">Hi {{FIRST_NAME}},</p><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;color:#3B3630;\">I’m reaching out because <strong>{{BUSINESS_NAME}}</strong> looks like the kind of <strong>{{BUSINESS_TYPE}}</strong> we would like to speak with: thoughtful presentation, premium service and clients who care how their color looks beyond the treatment room.</p><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0 0 18px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:16px;line-height:1.62;color:#3B3630;\">Sunless by Jimmy Coco brings believable, natural-looking color, a named service you can present as premium, and a focused aftercare edit for clients who want to maintain the result between visits.</p><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:2px 0 24px 0;\"><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:22px;padding:5px 0;color:#A77952;font-size:15px;\">•</td><td class=\"sans\" style=\"padding:5px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#3B3630;\">A distinctive professional treatment.</td></tr><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"width:22px;padding:5px 0;color:#A77952;font-size:15px;\">•</td><td class=\"sans\" style=\"padding:5px 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#3B3630;\">A relevant aftercare recommendation once the client sees a result they love.</td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" width=\"100%\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:4px 0 28px 0;\"><tr><td style=\"background:#F1E9DF;border-left:3px solid #A77952;padding:20px 22px;\"><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15.5px;line-height:1.55;color:#3B3630;\">Eligible U.S. professional partners can request a <strong>complimentary 100 ml professional trial sample</strong>. We review current availability for your business before shipping.</p></td></tr></table><table role=\"presentation\" cellpadding=\"0\" cellspacing=\"0\" border=\"0\" style=\"margin:8px 0 0 0;\"><tr><td bgcolor=\"#26231F\" style=\"border-radius:3px;\"><a href=\"{{TRIAL_LINK}}\" class=\"sans\" style=\"display:inline-block;padding:15px 30px;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.1em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#FFFDF9;text-decoration:none;border-radius:3px;\">Request professional trial information</a></td></tr></table><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:14px 0 0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;color:#7A726A;\">Or reply <strong>INFO</strong> and we will keep it straightforward.</p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:30px 52px 8px;\"><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:15px;line-height:1.6;color:#3B3630;\">{{SENDER_NAME}}<br><span style=\"color:#7A726A;font-size:13.5px;\">{{SENDER_TITLE}}</span></p></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:24px 52px 8px;\"><div style=\"border-top:1px solid #DCD2C6;\"></div></td></tr><tr><td class=\"px\" style=\"padding:14px 52px 30px;\"><p class=\"sans\" style=\"margin:0;font-family:'Helvetica Neue',Arial,sans-serif;font-size:11px;line-height:1.6;color:#948B81;\">Sunless by Jimmy Coco · Jimmy Coco LA Spray-Tan Studio · Suite 313, 9301 Wilshire Blvd, Beverly Hills, CA 90210<br>Advertisement from Jimmy Coco LA Spray-Tan Studio. <a href=\"{{RESEND_UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}\" style=\"color:#948B81;text-decoration:underline;\">Unsubscribe</a>.</p></td></tr></table></td></tr></table></body></html>",
    "text": "A premium tan is one appointment. The client relationship can continue after it.\n\nHi {{FIRST_NAME}},\n\nI’m reaching out because {{BUSINESS_NAME}} looks like the kind of {{BUSINESS_TYPE}} we would like to speak with: thoughtful presentation, premium service and clients who care how their color looks beyond the treatment room.\n\nSunless by Jimmy Coco brings believable, natural-looking color, a named service you can present as premium, and a focused aftercare edit for clients who want to maintain the result between visits.\n\n- A distinctive professional treatment.\n- A relevant aftercare recommendation once the client sees a result they love.\n\nEligible U.S. professional partners can request a complimentary 100 ml professional trial sample. We review current availability for your business before shipping.\n\nRequest professional trial information\n{{TRIAL_LINK}}\n\nOr reply INFO and we will keep it straightforward.\n\n{{SENDER_NAME}}\n{{SENDER_TITLE}}\n\nSunless by Jimmy Coco · Jimmy Coco LA Spray-Tan Studio · Suite 313, 9301 Wilshire Blvd, Beverly Hills, CA 90210\n\nAdvertisement from Jimmy Coco LA Spray-Tan Studio.\nUnsubscribe: {{RESEND_UNSUBSCRIBE_URL}}\n",
